      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Many centers across the country have used collaborative techniques to identify problems and come up with innovative solutions. Excellent improvements have been made in every aspect of the patient's journey through the cardiac surgery services, such as decreased length of stay, reduced clinical variation and costs, and improved outcome. We looked at how the cardiac surgical team at our center is helping to improve services for patients undergoing coronary revascularization. Improvements are not just focused on waiting lists or operating rooms but reflect the wider experience of patients and their families."},
